{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "de916bcbb7f287bf8fdf06fc030fbac1597f651bc3f135ea4ee7a05dbcd1184f", "ja": "（これから定期公演の打ち合わせ……なんだけど、\n今日はサプライズがある。みんなきっと驚くぞ！）", "zh": "（接下来要开定期公演的筹备会……不过，今天还有个惊喜。大家一定会吓一跳的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1001_p", "source_sha256": "08b0b45c061fcdc248fbe9314aa54bbb5dfa6266e2eaa8030c24dfde382bf5c9", "ja": "お疲れさま、亜利沙。真と可奈も揃ってるな。\n……というか、大丈夫か亜利沙？", "zh": "辛苦了，亚利沙。真和可奈也都到齐了啊。\n……话说回来，亚利沙，你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "531e7a3ce42115321b17da366aff850dd9e079e87df67224fd7ed9cd36e9b9ba", "ja": "……ハッ、{$P$}さん！\nすみません、ありさ、ちょっと天に召されてました♪", "zh": "……哈，{$P$}先生！\n不好意思，亚利沙刚才一不小心升天了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "34d7bacf2a818808327210794b3b911f64280eadc708c05e319ebf6a3ef2f392", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様～♪", "zh": "大家辛苦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "2f59e97639b26a9843febe2b1c0f5a072ea15932dc3f7cdf9037224498fe29f7", "ja": "美咲さん！　千早さん伊織さんも、お疲れ様でーす♪\n……はれっ？　美咲さんも？", "zh": "美咲小姐！千早小姐、伊织小姐也辛苦啦——♪\n……咦？美咲小姐也是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "4073569711967f009a6396e28deacdb97f50b00a46a6167367749eee702ec4c6", "ja": "珍しいですね。今日は美咲さんも、\n打ち合わせに参加するんですか？", "zh": "真少见呢。今天美咲也要参加会议吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3a6a0ce829b5d66e3bd2764f7c9bf05d136df04b60ed0ebb494ef1f52a9bdfe3", "ja": "うん、実は今度の公演に関係して、\n大きな案件が来てるんだ。青羽さん、お願いします。", "zh": "嗯，其实是因为下次公演来了个大项目。青羽小姐，拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "8515acc659d6056182942b96606566d70fccdddd34386cc95cb18c24ec4f2708", "ja": "はい♪　それじゃあ……うおっほん！　\nアイドル諸君、元気にしているかね～？", "zh": "好♪ 那么……咳咳！各位偶像，最近都还好吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "b1662e513c165027097023d4ae52e794821d6b669b292ca3ce01dc38141d7f72", "ja": "今回はね、松田君をはじめとした\n君たち5人に任せたい大仕事があるのだよ～！", "zh": "这次呢，我有一项重要工作想交给以松田同学为首的你们这5人～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "a567846c9c2594b9d55fa0846fa93e9c334d47977eaa584c744c6359239589b3", "ja": "青羽さん……のどを痛めたんですか？", "zh": "青羽小姐……是嗓子不舒服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "919913f94b839072f2e0ac9f347c160223a18a0d9c4c750dec5d4c86d4482946", "ja": "美咲、千早がヘンな心配しちゃうじゃない。\n社長のマネはいいから、普通に話しなさいよねっ。", "zh": "美咲，你这样会让千早担心的吧。别学社长说话了，正常说话啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "b1ffa289b84e64598c773c734eb4eecb3b01b7c00836c57be9ecf1cafaa7aefb", "ja": "えへへ、ごめんね、伝言だからつい……。\nそれでね、その大仕事って言うのは～。", "zh": "嘿嘿，对不起，因为是传话，一不小心就……  \n然后呢，你说的那个大工作就是～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "99f421ea77bff8798d3d93c9faf38b860eff5c1bc19db71b407a9107aa5a6dc9", "ja": "なんとっ！　私の地元の種子島から届いた、\n宇宙とのタイアップ企画でーす♪　パチパチパチパチ！", "zh": "没想到！这是从我老家种子岛寄来的、与宇宙合作的企划～♪　啪啪啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "7f7dc6ec9f41ee1fb5d6348e07bead917cfc4ec550425277338e301c21369fd7", "ja": "種子島から宇宙……あれ？　そういえばありさ、\n昨日宇宙のニュースを見たような……？", "zh": "从种子岛到宇宙……咦？说起来，亚利沙好像昨天看过宇宙的新闻……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "2b2bc8959bc9987b9e7aea5a0e252b7bbbffae2cdb0c4480ef4acc452b2dbc0e", "ja": "そう！　いま地球に接近中の『ミリオン彗星』に向けて\nもうすぐ探査機が打ち上げられるんだけど～。", "zh": "没错！为了飞向目前正接近地球的“百万彗星”，探测器马上就要发射了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "606ed75cccd940a1e9f34db27e47d3ee1400b5794b02d0850d8884eaadfb4514", "ja": "この度、その打ち上げを全国的に盛り上げよう！という\nタイアッププロモーションのオファーが届きました～！", "zh": "这次收到了合作宣传的邀约，说是要在全国范围内为这次发射助兴～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "e2641e23671be7f5d3644c611b2b313c8b5482cd9a37e1dc734609bec036ee58", "ja": "ええっ！？\nロケットの打ち上げとタイアップですか！？", "zh": "诶诶！？\n要和火箭发射展开合作吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "bba1386c7d777b031e1e1e3c562d11de03c379d6c8b2bdf380e68362ae020b2d", "ja": "すごいじゃないですか！　ついにボクたち765プロが\n宇宙に進出するんですね！？　やーりぃ！", "zh": "太厉害了吧！我们765事务所终于要进军宇宙了吧！？太棒啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "3900f7702db892bcacb0406293a8f5f07dd2c16f6dfb907b5c58834afa1dd814", "ja": "本当にすごいです！\n宇宙に夢中～♪　打ち上げに熱中～♪", "zh": "真的太厉害了！\n沉迷宇宙～♪ 热衷发射～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "f3276857ff344d42ff80908a5852bff93341a53af3684e551f138416b09ddec5", "ja": "はるかな宇宙に飛び立つ探査機の応援……。\nやりがいがあります。", "zh": "为飞向遥远宇宙的探测器加油……  \n真是件值得去做的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "1c31be51025c2bb2383f040a1e99ca7871e271b250b0dfadd816091dfba8a703", "ja": "美咲のツテでオファーが来たんですって。なかなか\n敏腕じゃない！　アンタもしっかりしなさいよね♪", "zh": "听说是通过美咲的人脉收到的邀约。还真是挺能干的嘛！你也给我认真点哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3a20ed940f061f97e9e26b05032a30e49e6cc8fd9db039947ccdc1f000f3ca64", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。具体的な仕事は、現地での\n応援ミニライブや劇場での応援公演ってことになる。", "zh": "嗯，没错。具体的工作，就是在现场举办助威迷你演出，以及在剧场举办助威公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1023_p", "source_sha256": "beadc50410ac3fa9ec8d4695a6198ed290dc8410d4366dd9c67aa6404228f28c", "ja": "クライアントは宇宙開発団体だし、社長じゃないけど\n本当に大きい仕事だ。亜利沙、しっかり頼むぞ！", "zh": "客户可是宇宙开发机构，虽然不是社长，但这确实是项大工作。亚利沙，可要好好拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "bd4b084f30a8d06602ee027e95a76728ae154ca6ef6a276e0554d4a4c27c6c64", "ja": "はい♪　……あれ？　どうしてありさにだけ……。\nはっ！　もしかして、その応援公演って……？", "zh": "好的♪……咦？为什么只有我……  \n啊！难道说，那个加油公演就是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1025_p", "source_sha256": "a38bdb0f61a8b02a3dbd5e6433327fd9b36c5bcd3a46b39cba3dd8ee3a291b31", "ja": "そう、今度の亜利沙のセンター公演。\nつまりこのコラボの主役は……亜利沙、お前だ！", "zh": "没错，就是下次的亜利沙中心公演。\n也就是说，这次合作的主角是……亜利沙，就是你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "48ab3f87af83bc9cca23a72543aeaf3d416fd74854a61cb8da976f1d2bf59456", "ja": "い、いえいえいえいえいえ！！　そういうこと\nでしたら、あの～、スケジュールを変えたほうが……？", "zh": "不、不不不不不！！　要是那样的话，\n那个～是不是调整一下日程比较好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "c6080eef03db0d5150028b86903406974b43f82a1b0129bf2f947fac0a3c900e", "ja": "ほら、ありさ宇宙のこともそんなに詳しくないですし！\n前に流星群とか調べましたけど、それっきりで～。", "zh": "你看，亚利沙对宇宙也不是那么了解嘛！之前虽然查过流星群什么的，但那之后就没再研究了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "59cdc4e0096a65969f26054602251fde1c6035f8ef67843f25da2e76b972fb11", "ja": "あはは、大丈夫だよ亜利沙！　ボクたちも宇宙は\n詳しくないけど、これから勉強すれば。ね♪", "zh": "啊哈哈，没关系的亚利沙！我们对宇宙也\n不太了解，从现在开始学就好啦。对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1029_002chi", "source_sha256": "e0b8e9cf070db88fd2d9f040aba35e6028f0e98f45f0a0d52a91153b89beb0ec", "ja": "そうね。松田さん、一緒に勉強していきましょう。", "zh": "是啊。松田小姐，我们一起学习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "cec01332ebc2a8868a43c7833bad079792981b8a780d41c9459e044c513b0667", "ja": "はっ！　千早ちゃんと真くんと一緒に！？", "zh": "哈！要和千早还有真一起学习！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "af64ca98ddc4818d442cc78cc0b9d4efc01abe38f9300e0626c15b9ecb3f7bae", "ja": "私もちんぷんかんぷんなので、よろしくお願いします！\n今日から宇宙のお勉強会ですね！", "zh": "我也完全搞不懂，所以请多关照！从今天开始就是宇宙学习会了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "3cbb9f209455615449154c7bbb4fc2b37cbb035f3e52882914d0e3029c07e4aa", "ja": "それに！　この宇宙一のスーパー美少女伊織ちゃんが\nいるんだもの。詳しくなくても、なんとかなるわ♪", "zh": "而且！有宇宙第一的超级美少女伊织在这里嘛。就算不太了解，也总会有办法的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1033_028ari", "source_sha256": "5fb3f84af0f2f2105e570a3c6f9d2137c0b57de4b26b725d7cfd423dc3501654", "ja": "可奈ちゃん、伊織ちゃんまで！\n現地……種子島……ずっと一緒……これは……！！", "zh": "连可奈和伊织也……！\n现场……种子岛……一直在一起……这难道是……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "fc3eea156d753c15a36300a360f48e395dc7d9ac05c1d770a471d454ba4bb81d", "ja": "わかりました、{$P$}さん。\nありさはこの大仕事で、燃え尽きる覚悟で頑張ります！", "zh": "明白了，{$P$}先生。\n亚利沙已经做好觉悟，要在这项大工作中拼尽全力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_114_1035_p", "source_sha256": "a01515de8e83428bb00a8507d779b2295cddb21f67682c56ca0d962e8fb4c834", "ja": "そ、そうか！　燃え尽きられると困るけど、\n乗り気になってくれてよかった。よろしく頼むぞ！", "zh": "这、这样啊！不过要是你燃尽了可就麻烦了，\n但你愿意积极起来真是太好了。接下来就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
